</node>
<node id="Crowded House">
  <data key="d0">BAND</data>
  <data key="d1">[{"text": "'Crowded House' is a band that The Walls opened up for on their first reunion gigs in Australia.", "chunk_id": "c543d9f719f81ba3", "doc_id": "hp_22cdae208a33e842"}]</data>
  <data key="d2">[{"text": "The following year the band travelled to Australia and played their first shows there, opening up for Crowded House on the latter's first reunion gigs.", "chunk_id": "c543d9f719f81ba3", "doc_id": "hp_22cdae208a33e842"}]</data>
