  <data key="d2">[{"text": "When Zakk was looking to form a band in 1998, Nick recommended drummer Phil Ondich to Zakk, 'Sonic Brew' was recorded, and in 1999, John DeServio was added to the lineup on bass – Black Label Society was officially formed.", "chunk_id": "6f8cd692ca8c4c37", "doc_id": "hp_c3744e475528ea1b"}]</data>
