  <data key="d5">["GENERALIZES"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Hahn series are a generalization of Puiseux series.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Hahn series (sometimes also known as Hahn–Mal'cev–Neumann series) are a generalization of Puiseux series.", "chunk_id": "f40ff7fcf0c6d4d5", "doc_id": "hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af", "type": "GENERALIZES"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hahn series" target="formula_1">
  <data key="d5">["SUPPORTED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Hahn series are supported by formula_1 when the set supporting them forms a well-ordered subset of the value group.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "They allow for arbitrary exponents of the indeterminate so long as the set supporting them forms a well-ordered subset of the value group (typically formula_1 or formula_2).", "chunk_id": "f40ff7fcf0c6d4d5", "doc_id": "hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af", "type": "SUPPORTED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hahn series" target="formula_2">
  <data key="d5">["SUPPORTED_BY"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Hahn series are supported by formula_2 when the set supporting them forms a well-ordered subset of the value group.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "They allow for arbitrary exponents of the indeterminate so long as the set supporting them forms a well-ordered subset of the value group (typically formula_1 or formula_2).", "chunk_id": "f40ff7fcf0c6d4d5", "doc_id": "hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af", "type": "SUPPORTED_BY"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hahn series" target="Hahn embedding theorem">
  <data key="d5">["INTRODUCED_IN"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Hahn series were introduced in the context of the proof of the Hahn embedding theorem.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Hahn series were first introduced, as groups, in the course of the proof of the Hahn embedding theorem.", "chunk_id": "f40ff7fcf0c6d4d5", "doc_id": "hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af", "type": "INTRODUCED_IN"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af</data>
</edge>
<edge source="Hahn series" target="Hilbert's seventeenth problem">
  <data key="d5">["APPLIED_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">Hahn series were used by Hans Hahn in his approach to Hilbert's seventeenth problem.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "Then studied by him as fields in his approach to Hilbert's seventeenth problem.", "chunk_id": "f40ff7fcf0c6d4d5", "doc_id": "hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af", "type": "APPLIED_TO"}]</data>
  <data key="d8">hp_6b4b5cbeeb7835af</data>
</edge>
