  <data key="d6">Settimia Caccini was the sister of Francesca Caccini.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "As well as her father being into music she also had an older sister who was a famous composer of the time. Although she is not as well known as her sister, Francesca Caccini, mostly due to the fact Settimia never published any of her own music composed pieces of music.", "chunk_id": "95c365ca672cb565", "doc_id": "hp_854c21bf573c6370", "type": "SISTER_OF"}]</data>
