  <data key="d5">["RELATED_TO"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The O'Reilly family are closely related to the Ó Ruairc (O'Rourkes).</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "O'Reilly is closely related to the Ó Ruairc (O'Rourkes) of West Bréifne.", "chunk_id": "78fd4cb76b773b67", "doc_id": "hp_e948ac4a8b3b56b7", "type": "RELATED_TO"}]</data>
