<edge source="O'Reilly" target="Irish Gaelic origin">
  <data key="d5">["ORIGINATED_FROM"]</data>
  <data key="d6">The O'Reilly family originated from Irish Gaelic origin.</data>
  <data key="d7">[{"text": "who were historically the kings of East Bréifne in what is today County Cavan. The clan were part of the Connachta's Uí Briúin Bréifne kindred and were ultimately all of Irish Gaelic origin,", "chunk_id": "78fd4cb76b773b67", "doc_id": "hp_e948ac4a8b3b56b7", "type": "ORIGINATED_FROM"}]</data>
